L["RELIQUIAR: Phase 2 Reflexion beachten! Unterbrecher bereit!"] = "RELIQUARY: Phase 2 watch the reflect! Interrupters ready!"
L["Phase 1: Wenig Heilung, schnell töten. Adds zwischen den Phasen weg."] = "Phase 1: little healing, kill fast. Clear adds between phases."
