L["KO'RAGH: Energiekugeln fangen! Barriere schnell brechen!"] = "KO'RAGH: Catch energy orbs! Break the barrier fast!"
L["Feuer: stapeln. Arkan: Tank raus. Frostkugel ausweichen."] = "Fire: stack. Arcane: tank out. Dodge the frost orb."
